# Component Registry Index
# All reusable building blocks for debian-composer recipes.
# Generated: 2026-03-23
#
# type: component   — standard package + config installer (default)
# type: content     — asset/file bundle (themes, wallpapers, dotfiles)
#
# subtype: service  — installs a systemd daemon; engine auto-verifies service+port
# subtype: bundle   — pure composition (no own packages); resolves requires: only
# subtype: bootstrap — package manager installer; resolved first, trust prompt shown
# (no subtype)      — standard component install

